      "content": "That's a good start for the overview. To help my students really build a \"winning\" case for the debate, they need more specifics. Could you break down those \"scientific\" arguments they used? Like, what were the actual theories they cited regarding biology or sociology to justify why they thought separation was \"necessary\" for society?",
